    "information": {
      "description": "<p><em>Iconic Super Groundcar.</em> Upgrades: Armored Chassis (w/ Stalwart Shell), Bulletproof Glass [x2], Communications Center, TUp (Turbocharged) Improved Engine, NOS [x3], Seating Upgrade, Security Upgrade (Advanced). Also: TUp (Improved) Racing Tires. Racing tires: +2 to Maneuvers on pavement. Ablation to its SP is 1 less (min 0). Basic driving needs Drive Land Vehicle Skill Base 14. A supercar in a Combat Cab's paint, checkered band, meter and roof light: nobody expects the taxi to do 400. It answers one call in a thousand, and only Sasquatch drives it.</p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> Not for sale (Super Luxury)<br><strong>Nomad:</strong> 10 (Combat Cab)<br><strong>SDP:</strong> 50<br><strong>SP:</strong> 13<br><strong>Seats:</strong> 4<br><strong>MOVE:</strong> 80<br><strong>Speed:</strong> 400 mph</p><p><small>Item Compendium (2070) • Vehicles</small></p>",
